## Quick Reference

### Restart All Services
```bash
kill $(ps aux | grep -E "bot.py|api_server.py" | grep -v grep | awk '{print $2}')
nohup python3 bot.py > bot.log 2>&1 &
nohup python3 api_server.py > api.log 2>&1 &
```

### View All Logs
```bash
tail -f bot.log api.log
```

### Check System Health
```bash
curl http://localhost:8000/health
```

### Broadcast Message to All Groups
```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/broadcast \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"message": "测试广播消息"}'
```

